Subject: sensor t40 sc830ai: Eufy OEM 5-mode variant (boot 4 = 3840x2160@20 2-lane 1080 Mbps)

Replaces the SDK 4-lane-only sc830ai.c with the Eufy OEM 5-mode driver
(verified on T8416 192.168.10.184). Applies to SDK 9e87773 only.

